{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-doloowee-model-aircraft-sold-via-amazon-2510-0174","content_id":"dfeade64-d7f0-44e2-a2e6-a245c4975c69","description":"Product Safety Report for Doloowee Model Aircraft presnting a serious risk of choking. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"f2816f1d-ca25-4f66-9a3c-16b312a69bcd","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-01-30T10:28:26+00:00","id":"f2816f1d-ca25-4f66-9a3c-16b312a69bcd","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-01-30T10:28:26+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/697c87caaacd0dc9777b5034/2510-0174-product-safety-report-doloowee-toy-plane.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Doloowee Model Aircraft sold via Amazon</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of choking as the button battery compartment of the product is not adequately secured and is easily accessible.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action:  The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys – Toy Model Construction (Non Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Doloowee</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>YH-09A</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>A red and white toy model aircraft packaged in a white box.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_f2816f1d-ca25-4f66-9a3c-16b312a69bcd\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/697c87caaacd0dc9777b5034/2510-0174-product-safety-report-doloowee-toy-plane.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a chemical risk and a risk of choking as the button battery compartment of the product is not adequately secured and is easily accessible. The button batteries may be placed in the mouth and swallowed, presenting a choking hazard to young children and causing damage to the gastrointestinal tract.  </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2510-0174</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-01-30T10:29:49Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["destruction-of-the-product","import-rejected-at-border","removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-01-30","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-01-30T10:29:49+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-doloowee-model-aircraft-sold-via-amazon-2510-0174","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/conten